# Security response headers, served by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (it honors _headers).
# Addresses the (unscored) Lighthouse security recommendations: a Content Security Policy,
# a strong HSTS policy (with preload), and clickjacking / MIME protections.
#
# CSP notes for maintainers:
#   - script-src is tight: 'self' + the inline anti-FOUC theme script ('unsafe-inline',
#     unavoidable on a static build with no per-request nonce) + the Cloudflare Web
#     Analytics beacon. It still blocks externally-loaded scripts.
#   - img-src / media-src allow https: so Sanity images (cdn.sanity.io) and editor-added
#     images / background videos load.
#   - frame-src lists the embeds actually used (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps). If a church
#     later adds a Subsplash / Planning Center script or iframe embed via the page builder,
#     add its origin to script-src / frame-src.
#   - connect-src covers the contact forms (Web3Forms) + analytics; add a newsletter or
#     Formspree origin here if one is enabled.
#   - frame-ancestors is 'self' (the Studio iframe "Preview" was removed, so the live site
#     no longer needs to be embedded by the Studio).
#   - Trusted Types is intentionally NOT enabled: require-trusted-types-for would break the
#     YouTube / Vimeo / Maps / analytics / embed scripts.

# The embedded Sanity Studio at /studio needs three things this policy did not
# grant, because until 2026-09-06 this repo had no Studio to serve (it was a
# separate hosted deploy):
#   - font-src design-system-static.sanity.io, the Studio's own Inter
#   - connect-src the Sanity API and its websocket, plus sanity-cdn.com, which
#     the Studio pings for its module/version check
#   - worker-src blob:, for the Studio's web workers
# Without them the Studio renders and then reports "Couldn't reach the Sanity
# servers", which looks like a network or CORS fault and is neither: the
# requests are refused locally by this header before they leave the browser.
# Values match presacademy, whose embedded Studio has run on them for weeks.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https:; media-src 'self' https:; font-src 'self' https://design-system-static.sanity.io; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.web3forms.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://api.sanity.io https://*.api.sanity.io wss://*.api.sanity.io https://*.apicdn.sanity.io https://sanity-cdn.com https://*.sanity-cdn.com; frame-src 'self' https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com; form-action 'self' https://api.web3forms.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; upgrade-insecure-requests
